      },
      {
        "finding": "On MOSSBench, DACO's over-refusal rates stay near No Steering (average 0.11 vs 0.09). ActAdd (0.18) and Prompting (0.22) over-refuse more.",
        "proposed_claim": "Concept-steering detoxification can avoid much of the over-refusal produced by additive steering.",
        "row_ids": [
          "r22",
