    "peer_reviewed": "preprint",
    "problems": "The experiments do not test the claim's single refusal direction, and the paper's safety scores are benchmark/judge classifications rather than direct measurements of that direction's mediation of refusal. The selected steering intervention is limited to layers 15–19 and the first 50 generated tokens.",
    "rows_left_out": "Detailed per-category safety scores in Tables 7–8, SAE training/reconstruction metrics in Tables 4 and 6, open-ended utility results in Table 11, and detoxification fine-tuning results in Table 12 are not extracted: they concern the paper's broad DACO/SAE pipeline rather than the claim's specified direction. Hyperparameter plot values are not transcribed because the text describes trends but gives no exact plotted values.",
    "untested": [
