    "verdict_notes": "The dictionary-partition prompt labels the concept 'refusal' as desirable, so refusal is among the promoted concepts. It is one WordNet concept from captions, not a harmful-minus-harmless instruction direction, and no separate effect is reported. The rows compare the paper's own method with baselines and correctly link to no version."
